scenario w4-lost-latest-dangles-3.2
# W4 on 3.2: there is no handoff, `latest` keeps the lost client, and with two
# sizing clients left the window freezes at the lost client's size.
versions 3.2
session O 80x24 w0
group O-tessera-view O
session probes 80x24 p0
control probe probes no-output
control side O-tessera-view no-output
send side refresh-client -C 90,28
tty laptop O 200x50
key laptop
control device O
send device select-window ; refresh-client -C 100,30
expect-latest w0 device
expect-size w0 100x30
detach device
expect-latest w0 dangling:device
expect-size w0 100x30
send probe display-message -p -t {w0} 'size=#{window_width}x#{window_height}'
expect probe size=100x30
